  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is implemented in the Philippines.The main outcome areas it contributes to are Equality and Worker&apos;s Rights, Democracy and Human Rights,  Just transition and Gender equality. The main right holders are the members of the National Confederation of Transportworkers&apos; Unions.Through conferences, trainings and leadership development the project aims to achieve that the NCTU and its affiliates are consolidated as democratic and sustainable unions capable of representing transport workers in all levels of decision-making areas.</narrative>
  </description>
